<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bergen Brunswig upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bergen Brunswig upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch analyst Richard Vietor said he upgraded his long-term rating of Bergen Brunswig Corp to buy from accumulate, keeping his near-term rating at accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said stock is undervalued relative to its peers and valuation should move closer to a market price/earnings ratio.</p>
<p>-- estimates five-year earnings growth rate in the mid-teens.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1997 earnings $2.10 a share.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1998 earnings $2.45 a share.</p>
</text>
